+- **Request 18**: Add late fee calculation
+  - Added lateFee(invoice, asOf) to src/reports.js
+  - Returns late fee in cents for an invoice as of a given date
+  - Calculation: 0.04% per day of amount still due
+  - Formula: amountDue * 0.0004 * daysOverdue
+  - Returns 0 if invoice is not overdue (dueDate >= asOf)
+  - Returns 0 if no amount due (fully paid)
+  - daysOverdue calculated using daysBetween(dueDate, asOf)
+  - amountDue calculated using balanceDue(invoice)
+  - Returns value rounded and clamped to >= 0
+  - Added 13 comprehensive tests for late fee functionality
+  - All 248 tests passing (235 existing + 13 new)
+
 ## Constraints
 - Money is always integer cents (use roundCents())
 - Never throw; return fail(CODE) with codes in ERRORS
